    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271364</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あーの、タンス野郎！
またフラフラと勝手に
どっか行きやがった</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, great, that stupid closet
freak's wandered off again!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271456</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>たまにはいいじゃない。
寄り道した時ぐらい
自由行動したって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I mean, that's okay sometimes, right?
He's just taking some time to himself
while we've stopped in town...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271552</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Mel&gt;がそうやって
甘やかすから、
あいつがつけあがるんだろ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's 'cause you're so soft
on him that he's always
causing problems, &lt;Mel&gt;!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271640</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あれ～？
でも、&lt;Dio&gt;だって
よくフラフラしてるけド～？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmm, I see... But, &lt;Dio&gt;, don't you
wander off alone a lot, too?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271760</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そ、それは、昔の話で、
最近はそんなにふらふら……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Th-That's... I haven't done
that in a long time, okay...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271760</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あー、ほら、
タンス探しに行くぞ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Uh, anyway! I gotta go find him!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271808</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>まったく、もう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Sheesh...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271852</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>クルール！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Couleuru!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
